  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING (binary): ConfigInstance.BuildServiceProvider() now returns the concrete ServiceProvider instead of IServiceProvider, so the caller can dispose it. A return type is part of the signature, so any assembly compiled against 0.1.5 throws MissingMethodException against this version and must be recompiled. Source-compatible for callers assigning to IServiceProvider.\nAlso adds a non-blocking CreateAsync for the persistent environment context and marks the blocking constructor obsolete.",
